        "receive-gift :parameters (?recipient - actor ?donor - actor ?gift - item) :precondition (and (not (= ?recipient ?donor)) (happy ?donor) (not (has ?recipient ?gift)) (has ?donor ?gift)) :effect (and (has ?recipient ?gift) (happy ?recipient)))": "(:action receive-gift :parameters (?recipient - actor ?donor - actor ?gift - item) :precondition (and (not (= ?recipient ?donor)) (happy ?donor) (not (has ?recipient ?gift)) (has ?donor ?gift)) :effect (and (has ?recipient ?gift) (happy ?recipient)))",
