        "take-toy :parameters (?a1 - actor ?a2 - actor ?t - item) :precondition (and (not (= ?a1 ?a2)) (has ?a2 ?t) (not (has ?a1 ?t))) :effect (and (not (has ?a2 ?t)) (has ?a1 ?t) (sad ?a2)))": "(:action take-toy :parameters (?a1 - actor ?a2 - actor ?t - item) :precondition (and (not (= ?a1 ?a2)) (has ?a2 ?t) (not (has ?a1 ?t))) :effect (and (not (has ?a2 ?t)) (has ?a1 ?t) (sad ?a2)))",
